  "headline": "Bodvar + Starolfr (2-boss) guide (God of War Ragnarok): positioning, visibility, and safe punish windows",
  "description": "The 2-boss Berserker fight is won by visibility. Keep both bosses on-screen, punish only at landings and charge ends, and use a fixed reset step when spacing breaks.",
  "keywords": [
    "bodvar the fierce guide",
    "starolfr the troublesome guide",
    "2 boss fight",
    "berserker",
    "svartalfheim"
  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Failure mode\nOff-screen hits snowball when rushes and dives overlap.\n\n2) Core plan\n- camera is a mechanic: reposition until both bosses are visible\n- punish only at fixed end states (landings, rush ends)\n\n3) Steps\n1) move to keep both in frame\n2) take one safe punish on the safer target\n3) disengage and reset if the camera breaks\n\n4) Three punish windows\n- dive landing\n- rush end\n- end of big swing follow-through\n\nRelated: use the all-Berserkers index for clear order and gravestone navigation.",
